00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:26.930
Among them, Oda Nobunaga was only a 
small step away from seizing total power.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.960
Oda Nobunaga

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:34.090
But he was taken down at Honnou-ji, 
by the betrayal of his vassal Akechi Mitsuhide.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.590
Akechi           Mitsuhide

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:39.800
But Akechi Mitsuhide himself was defeated by Toyotomi Hideyoshi,

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:44.000
and the world once more descended into conflict.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:40.970
Toyotomi Hideyoshi

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.980
Takenaka         Hanbei

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:50.110
Toyotomi Hideyoshi toppled warlord after warlord, becoming a force to reckon with.

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:55.320
Before his might, many warlords were cowed into silence, and few dared to openly oppose him.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:59.950
Then, the Toyotomi army headed east to swallow Houjou whole.

