00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:03.580
As if to defy Toyotomi's unstoppable onslaught,

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:08.040
a single man advanced towards Houjou Ujimasa's stronghold, Odawara Castle.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:11.090
Lord of Oushuu, Date Masamune.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.300
Are you ready, guys?!

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:14.420
Yeah!

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.470
Date

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.470
Date

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.470
Masamune

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.470
Masamune

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:20.930
Let's start the party for total conquest!

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:34.570
It is almost two point
five decades since I was born

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:36.950
I've had so many of jellos so far

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.740
and how many more will I swallow from now on?

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:43.200
I've already taken tons of exams

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.660
and what else is coming up to me from now on?

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.830
Daily lives must pass by quickly
without any "likes" and "hates"

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.500
That girl who falls for guys easily,

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.960
fell for another one then another
one and another one each time

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:54.380
For a guy without such experience

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.630
Everyday life now is like a stormy river

00:01:58.630 --> 00:01:59.840
So fast!

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.140
Break out!

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:12.520
(so) I sing to myself before I get sunk

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:17.400
I jumped out to stop the streaming days

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:23.950
The coastline I ran on that strong sunny day
(Shore line I ran)

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:28.620
If you wanna take back that feeling
(take back that feeling)

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:32.880
That feeling and give it a deep color of your own self
(take back that feeling)

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.800
First, smash down that door

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.230
Oyakata-sama!

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:47.860
Oyakata-sama!

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:52.360
Oyakata-sama, Toyotomi is headed to Odawara!

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.380
It means he is attacking Houjou!

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:56.940
The Takeda must hasten with our troops—

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.740
Don't get distracted, Yukimura!

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:06.710
But my lord, if Odawara should fall,

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.500
it is inevitable that he will invade Kai!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:12.260
All the more reason to stay calm!

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:25.380
It is at times like these that analyzing the situation carefully is our highest priority.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:28.810
Of course, my lord.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:34.190
I was about to plunge forward on 
pure impulse without thinking ahead.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.080
Fool!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:43.660
However, <i>that</i> attitude spells the end of your warrior spirit!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.400
Oyakata-sama!

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.320
My warrior spirit...

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:48.830
will never disappear!

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.460
That's right, raise your spirits, Yukimura!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.460
Oyakata-sama!

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.430
My enthusiasm knows no bounds!{it's 猛っている}

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.430
Sanada   Yukimura

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.430
Sanada   Yukimura

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.970
That's right! Even more, Yukimura!

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:02.970
Takeda     Shingen

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:02.970
Takeda     Shingen

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:04.920
Oyakata-sama!

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:06.000
Yukimura!

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.220
Oyakata-sama!

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.440
Yukimura!

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:09.440
For heaven's sake.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:14.440
Farewell

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:14.440
Farewell

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.700
Odawara

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:30.120
Curses! Who does that commoner Toyotomi think he is?! {*}{it's fine / 成り上がりの~ since he was like the lowest in social rank}

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.750
Trying to rule the world with brute strength?{世を治める I think} He has not a shred of honor or class!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.840
Hideyoshi, it seems like this will end 
without you having to make an appearance.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:40.970
Hanbei.

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:44.260
It is thanks to your wisdom that our army was able to completely overwhelm him.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.970
You may safely rest.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:47.820
Thank you, Hideyoshi.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.230
I will do so.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:51.880
Ieyasu-kun, Mitsunari-kun.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.750
I leave the rest to you.

00:04:53.750 --> 00:05:01.490
I, Mitsunari, along with Ieyasu, swear on my life that we will be of use.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.750
Fall, Houjou. This country does not need weakness.

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:11.580
If only my ancestors were here...

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.020
No, even I can...

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.160
Lord, please don't!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.250
Don't stop me!

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:20.160
I want to try to win, just once!

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:23.260
Houjou    Ujimasa

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:23.260
Houjou    Ujimasa

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.260
M-My back...

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:24.640
Lord!

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:26.160
Where's Fuuma?!

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:28.140
Fuuma!

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:35.960
A rumble in the sky, a flash of light along the ground. {*}{fine. it's just describing the barrage in a kakkoii fashion}

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:37.820
Beware our barrage!

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:39.340
Fire!

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:42.070
Saika    Magoichi

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.980
The firearms of Saika will change the course of the war.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.580
Do you understand that now?

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.080
Fuuma    Kotarou

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.080
Fuuma    Kotarou

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:56.340
Know that no number of ninjas can 
stand against the mighty Saika battalion! {*}{well here it's 雑賀衆 so I guess battalion is ok}

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:06.970
Honda  Tadakatsu

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:06.970
Honda  Tadakatsu

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:12.300
The Saika battalion at the west gate is doing well.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.960
As long as nothing unexpected happens,

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:17.580
Odawara is ours.

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:33.750
Will fate not let me walk by your side, Hideyoshi?

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:34.700
Masamune-sama!

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.860
If the troops realize we've gone ahead, their formation will break down. {*}{the troops they're leading, I assume? sounds right}{this is way too fucking long}

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:37.620
No problem!

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:40.130
There isn't anyone who can stop me!

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:43.540
Until I reach Odawara—no, until I reach total conquest,

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.560
I'm not planning on slowing down!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.430
<i>Sanada Yukimura.</i>

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.890
<i>I'm going to gain total conquest of this land before you.</i>

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:55.650
<i>What are you going to do about it?</i>

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:02.500
Excuse me, my lord!

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:03.720
What is it?

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:07.020
According to our scouts, there is an army approaching Odawara.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:08.740
What army is it?{何処の軍, i.e., where is the army from}

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.360
Sir! It is the army of Date-sama of Oushuu.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.620
Masamune-dono?

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.060
Oh, so the One-Eyed Dragon has made a move, huh?

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:15.660
Oyakata-sa—

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.080
Quiet, Yukimura!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.020
I-I haven't said anything yet!

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.840
I know what you want to say.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:25.320
You want to lead the Takeda soldiers 
after Date, and defeat Toyotomi, right?

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:26.930
That is exactly right!

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:30.430
After we defeat Toyotomi, I will settle 
my score with Date{*}{政宗殿との雌雄を決し, so it's right}, and conquer the—

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:31.930
Fool!

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.180
It is not yet the time for action.

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:39.100
B-But my lord, if Odawara falls...

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.150
Houjou will not fall so easily.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:44.420
But Houjou-dono cannot oppose 
Toyotomi now, as mighty as he is— {*}{what's unsure here? sounds right. 今の豊富を撥ね除けることなど — implying Toyotomi is now much more powerful than he once was}

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:46.070
Don't you realize yet, Yukimura?

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:50.070
Toyotomi's enemy isn't Houjou or Date.

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.780
Then what army could it be?

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.600
There is another tiger.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.080
Tiger?

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.860
What's the situation?

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:04.440
We have called for the Houjou forces to
 surrender, but it seems they do not trust us.

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:06.030
In that case, we will wait.

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.500
The fact that they are not attacking means they are considering it.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:15.350
Now that the west gate has fallen to Saika, they should 
realize that there is no point in defending this east gate.

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:18.580
I want to minimize casualties.{as much as possible}{"minimize" is sufficient}

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.420
Right.

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.440
You made the right decision!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.800
Will you guarantee our safety, as promised?

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:33.780
Of course!

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.120
Your protection—

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:47.900
Wh-What's going on?

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:49.080
Stop firing!

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.760
B-Bastards... {why cant i think of a better word for this}{dastardly, dirty trick, etc}

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:01.560
Toyotomi soldiers?

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:04.000
Well done, Tokugawa.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.400
Gyoubu! What's the meaning of this?!

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.460
Have you forgotten our lord's orders?

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:11.080
He decreed that we leave no Houjou soldier alive.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:11.660
But..

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:16.660
Thanks to you, we have taken the east gate with no losses.

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.660
Ootani   Yoshitsugu

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.660
Ootani   Yoshitsugu

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:21.360
The castle will fall shortly. {*}{天守 (castle tower) もまもなく落ちる — looks fine}

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:24.920
It looks like Gyoubu has taken the east gate.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.740
Excuse me, my lord!

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:27.580
What is it?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:30.880
We have news of an army approaching Odawara rapidly from the north!

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.180
Their banner belongs to Date of Oushuu!

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:37.200
One-Eyed Dragon, what do you plan to do with just one brigade?{in this scene "army" might be too general since it doesn't serve as a counter like 一軍— apparently 12,500 people — try something like a brigade?}

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.260
Hideyoshi-sama.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:42.400
Please allow me to slaughter every last man who opposes you. {*}{豊富に仇なす賊を惨殺する許可を — wrongs -> opposes?}

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.020
You may go.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:44.560
Yes, sir.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:48.070
I am most grateful.

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:51.320
Do you think I don't know you're there?

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.990
I wasn't especially trying to hide.

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:55.780
But you weren't noticing me.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:58.920
Even though Takeda and Uesugi maintain good relations,

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:01.090
I have no intention of getting along with you.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:01.790
Kasuga

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:03.290
That's pretty cold.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.830
Sarutobi   Sasuke

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.830
Sarutobi   Sasuke

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:06.700
So, what's the situation out there?

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.960
Can't you tell? It's obviously Toyotomi's victory.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.590
Oh? I wouldn't be so sure.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:12.760
Do you think Houjou can still win?

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:17.040
I won't go that far. But the only sure thing about war is that anything can happen.

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.600
Go straight!

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:22.100
Let's break through!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:23.850
Katakura   Kojuurou

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:23.850
Katakura   Kojuurou

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:26.110
What's wrong, Kojuurou?

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:29.110
You don't look like you're about to unleash a party.

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:32.910
Toyotomi will have heard of our movements by now.

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.610
There may be enemy troops lying in ambush here.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.980
Hideyoshi wouldn't do something so lame.

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:42.000
Well, not like monkey hunting would entertain me anyway.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.480
You mustn't make light of Toyotomi, Masamune-sama!

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:48.340
The strength that subjugated most of the west is quite real and—{fine}

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:51.620
Your job is to watch my back.

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:53.380
As long as you're behind me,

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.890
there's no way I'll fall! {btw this MY SHIP, like, the reason i love this show is because of these two guys, right here}

00:10:55.890 --> 00:11:00.010
Toyotomi's just a means to a end. I'm looking beyond him!

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:01.500
Follow me, Kojuurou!

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:02.200
Yes, sir!

00:11:04.150 --> 00:11:05.520
Hideyoshi-sama!

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:06.760
Hideyoshi-sama!

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:08.660
Hideyoshi-sama! {this guy is fucking insane}

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:14.660
Hideyoshi is the supreme ruler{haisha}, Hanbei watches over the land{yo wo miwatasu}

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:17.900
Gyoubu uses the people, Ieyasu manipulates the soldiers.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.000
I must be useful as well.

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:24.740
I will not forgive those who stand in my way!

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:30.670
What do you want, Ieyasu?

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:36.800
Tokugawa

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:36.800
Tokugawa

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:36.800
Ieyasu

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:36.800
Ieyasu

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.660
Stop!

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:42.860
Who's this guy?

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:43.680
That's...

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.430
DAIICHI DAIMAN DAIKICHI

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.430
DAIICHI DAIMAN DAIKICHI

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:49.180
Toyotomi's right-hand man, Ishida Mitsunari.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:52.560
So he thinks his errand boy alone is enough to stop me?

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.400
Who does he think I am?

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.700
Fine. If you want me, come at me.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:01.080
If you don't make the first move, you're gonna be sorry.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:01.870
Okay?

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:05.910
Ishida   Mitsunari

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:05.910
Ishida   Mitsunari

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:07.370
Lord Hideyoshi.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:09.880
Please pull back your troops.

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:12.120
This is wrong.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:15.010
That type of sentiment is what weakened this country.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:18.780
Hideyoshi-dono, you've changed.

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:22.300
The demon of disease that's eaten Hanbei's body has devoured your heart as well!

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.560
Ridiculous!

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:26.980
Will nothing I say reach you?

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:29.480
If I said no, what would you do?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.860
Would you strike me down?

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:50.110
If you defeat me, how will you rule this country?

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:51.080
With bonds!

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:52.520
What?

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:55.630
I believe that bonds are the more powerful than brute strength.

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:57.940
The feelings that connect people...

00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:00.300
I will govern the land with the power of bonds!

