00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:06.140
You are weak as well, Ieyasu!

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.350
Lord Hideyoshi, I will defeat you!

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.610
I'm ready anytime.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:19.200
Come at me.

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:24.370
I'd rather not waste my breath on a rebel like you!

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:24.870
He's fast!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:33.880
Kojuurou!

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:49.100
Die!

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:50.270
Stop!

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:54.310
Masamune... sama...

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.070
This isn't like you, Kojuurou.

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:58.570
Warming up before we face the monkey?

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:02.320
I am the Lord of Oushuu, Date Masamune! I—

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.320
I don't care you who are!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:07.080
Shut up and let me scatter your ashes!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:11.830
As proof of my loyalty, I will present your body as an offering to Hideyoshi-sama.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:15.760
I don't think that man is worth that much.

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:17.750
You bastard!

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:31.020
Toyotomi stands at the summit of all!

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:33.440
Everyone that defies him...

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:38.380
is fated to become silent corpses!

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:42.520
Within Hideyoshi-sama's sparkling brilliance,

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.460
your existence...

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:49.200
is not permitted!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.580
Shit!

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:10.180
Death Fang!

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:18.620
It's useless, no matter what you try.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:23.190
The moment you pointed your blade at 
Hideyoshi-sama, your defeat was inevitable.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:28.200
You'll be just another fallen flower in my lord's path to supremacy!

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:30.200
Ouch!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.080
I won't let you!

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.000
Kojuu... rou...

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:45.090
Hideyoshi-sama, permit Ieyasu and I to present you with a shining victory!

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:10.700
Hideyoshi!

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:17.960
That is...

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.330
Hideyoshi-sama's voice!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.420
Hideyoshi-sama! What has happened?!

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:28.930
That's...

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:30.120
What is it?

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.050
Is it over?

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.810
Hideyoshi-sama! Hideyoshi-sama!

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:38.260
Hideyoshi-sama!

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:42.000
Hanbei-sama?!

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:43.840
Hanbei-sama!

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:46.760
Hanbei-sama.

00:16:46.760 --> 00:16:48.800
Mitsunari-kun.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:50.140
What happened?

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.490
Never mind me.

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:53.990
Go to Hideyoshi.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:56.720
Sorry, Mitsunari-kun.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:58.500
I'm making you bear this burden alone.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:00.290
I'll return shortly.

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:03.790
Take care of Hideyoshi.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:06.220
Mitsunari-sama!

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:09.860
What happened? Did a Houjou spy infiltrate us?

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:11.180
Tokugawa...

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:14.820
Tokugawa Ieyasu has turned against us!

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.440
Ieyasu is not that kind of man.

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:39.660
Hideyoshi... sama...

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:43.210
Hideyoshi-sama!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.710
Hideyoshi-sama!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.200
Hideyoshi-sama!

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:49.640
Answer me, Hideyoshi-sama!

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.220
Hideyoshi-sama...

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:55.280
Ieyasu!

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:56.860
Why, Ieyasu?

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:59.220
You were here, yet Hideyoshi-sama has fallen.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:00.980
Why didn't you protect him?

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:04.420
I had no other choice.

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.520
What... are you talking about?

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.620
Brute strength will not bring peace to the country.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:12.240
Bonds will.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.120
What do you mean?

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.120
Don't tell me...

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:22.120
You... betrayed us?

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:26.380
Did you betray us, Ieyasu?

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:35.020
Hideyoshi-sama... trusted you!

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:42.240
Didn't you share the same vision that 
Hideyoshi-sama and Hanbei-sama had?

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:44.900
We can't return to the way things were back then.

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:50.780
Farewell.

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:54.910
Wait, Ieyasu...

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:57.300
Ieyasu!

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:01.660
Ieyasu!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:06.420
Hideyoshi-sama!

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:16.930
Hanbei-sama...

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.460
Mitsunari-kun.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:22.060
I deeply apologize, but Hideyoshi-sama has...

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:27.190
Oh, Hideyoshi, you've returned.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.540
I'm all right now.

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:33.940
I should be able to join you in your next battle.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:38.620
With Ieyasu-kun and Mitsunari-kun, Toyotomi stands strong.

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:41.340
Hanbei-sama?

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:44.580
We're just one step away from realizing our dream.

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:50.020
Now, Hideyoshi, where shall we go next?

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.840
Hanbei-sama...

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:03.500
Hanbei-sama!

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.230
Hanbei-sama!

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:12.540
Hanbei-sama!

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:16.260
Did Tokugawa ruin everything?

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:17.740
